      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Greedy commitments can be wrong: there is no optimality guarantee.\nTraining requires labeled solutions; constraints need specific rules.\nReported gains depend on the task, inference budget and local search.\nMore complex constraints remain a limitation (e.g., vehicle capacity).",
      "originalText": "Greedy commitments can be wrong: there is no optimality guarantee.\nTraining requires labeled solutions; constraints need specific rules.\nReported gains depend on the task, inference budget and local search.\nMore complex constraints remain a limitation (e.g., vehicle capacity).",
